<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/inventions?focus=steamship">Inventions &amp; Discoveries</a> · Transport and navigation</p><h1 class="enc-title">Steamship</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as steam-powered warships</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">A steamship is a ship powered by a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/steam-engine">steam engine</a>. In the nineteenth century steam warships carried Western power to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/east-asia">East Asia</a>: a British fleet that included the iron steamer Nemesis overcame the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qing-empire">Qing Empire</a>'s coastal defences in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/first-opium-war">First Opium War</a> of 1839–1842, and in 1853 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/matthew-c-perry">Commodore Matthew Perry</a>'s squadron, which included steam-powered warships, entered <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/edo-bay">Edo Bay</a> and demanded that the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tokugawa-shogunate">Tokugawa Shogunate</a> open <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/japan">Japan</a>'s ports.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/steamship.jpg" alt="Steamship" width="320" height="191" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Herbythyme · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Waverley_at_Swanage.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="inv-entry"><h2 class="enc-section-title">On the inventions tree</h2><dl class="inv-entry-facts"><div><dt>First known</dt><dd>1783</dd></div></dl><p class="inv-entry-note"><span class="inv-k">Note</span>This was the Pyroscaphe, the first working steamboat; the first sea-going steamship, Richard Wright’s Experiment, sailed in 1813.</p><div class="inv-entry-rel"><span class="inv-k">Built on</span><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/sail">Sail<span>6th millennium BCE</span></a><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/steam-engine">Steam engine<span>1606</span></a></div><div class="inv-entry-rel"><span class="inv-k">Led to</span><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/ironclad">Ironclad warship<span>1859</span></a></div><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/inventions?focus=steamship">See it on the inventions tree &rarr;</a></p></section>
